5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a fair system for the bike spaces.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree, Asuka. But I’ve heard people grumbling that the same spots always go to the same doors.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,- **Ryuji**: The morning rush is getting worse. I’ve seen people shoving to get their bikes out.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,- **Yumi**: That sounds stressful. I hope we can find a way to ease that tension for everyone.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,- **Ryuji**: It’s not just stress. It’s about who gets the dry spots and who gets the rain.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,- **Shunichi**: And who pays for the fix? Nobody ever checks the actual cost before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I’m curious what the actual workload would be to manage this, month after month.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: I’m curious what the actual workload would be to manage this, month after month.""}]}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: I worry that any new rule will just create new conflicts in the lobby.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: I just want to know if the current spots actually match where people park, or if it’s just a rumor.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: It’s about the physical reality. If your bike is buried, you’re stuck.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: Exactly. We keep debating the principle, but nobody bothers to check the ledger to see if we can actually afford the solution.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. I want to see the handover file to understand the real administrative burden before we commit.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: Agreed. I want to see the handover file to understand the real administrative burden before we commit.""}]}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: I’ll check the complaint log and the neighbouring block’s account to see how this usually ends.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,- **Yumi**: I’ll check the sticker register and the five years of minutes to see who actually rides and who holds the spots.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,- **Ryuji**: I’ll check the morning departures and the rain exposure to see the actual daily reality.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,- **Shunichi**: I’ll check the building account's two-year ledger and the ward cycle park by the station.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’ll check the treasurer's handover file and the trial of the supplier's display frame.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
