34,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: The complaint log shows nine unresolved notes, and the neighbouring block’s secretary says their charge made two households stop attending meetings.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,- **Yumi**: The minutes show the same flats held the covered spots for five years without review.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: The ledger is empty for capital work, and the station park costs 2,600 yen with a waiting list.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: That confirms my fear. A charge that drives people away is a failure, not a solution.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,- **Yumi**: And the sticker register shows daily riders would rather pay than be treated as equal claimants.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: The rain data is clear. The eaves stay dry, but past the downpipe, saddles are soaked by morning.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: So the station park is full and expensive. We can’t outsource this problem, and we have no capital funds to fix it.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,- **Toshio**: The display frame trial showed hoisting takes twenty seconds and needs greasing twice a year.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: So a paid system risks isolating people, and a shared rack adds maintenance we can’t afford.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: But if the daily riders prefer paying, maybe a small fee is better than a lottery that ignores their needs.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: The rain exposure is the real issue. If the dry spots are fixed, the shoving match just moves to the wet ones.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: The ledger confirms we have zero capital. Any physical fix is a levy, and the station park proves demand is high.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"- **Toshio**: The greasing is trivial, but the handover file shows three hours monthly just for cash reconciliation.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: So we are choosing between a fee that alienates people and a lottery that ignores the daily reality.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,- **Yumi**: I’m worried a lottery feels unfair to those who ride every single day.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: The physical layout dictates the conflict. Without moving the dry spots, any rule just shifts the frustration.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: A lottery costs nothing to run, unlike the fee which adds three hours of your time monthly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,A lottery is administratively free. That is the only option that doesn’t add to my monthly burden.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
56,3,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
