59,3,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: The options are A: Paid Allocation, B: Annual Lottery, and C: Shared Racks.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: Option B feels the fairest, but I worry it ignores the daily riders who need those spots most.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: Option C solves the rain problem, but the greasing and hoisting effort is a burden I don't want to carry.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: Option A is a trap. The ledger is empty, and the station park proves people will pay, but we can't afford the admin.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option C requires physical maintenance I am not willing to take on. Option B is the only one that keeps my workload at zero.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: Option C requires physical maintenance I am not willing to take on. Option B is the only one that keeps my workload at zero.""}]}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: Option B is the only one that doesn't risk the social friction I saw in the complaint log.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,- **Yumi**: But the sticker register showed daily riders prefer paying. A lottery might feel unfair to them.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,- **Ryuji**: Option C is the only one that actually stops the morning shoving match.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Option A is a financial and administrative nightmare. We have no capital, and the reconciliation burden is already too high.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shunichi"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shunichi: Option A is a financial and administrative nightmare. We have no capital, and the reconciliation burden is already too high.""}]}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I stand by my position. Option B is the only choice that does not add to my monthly administrative load.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: I stand by my position. Option B is the only choice that does not add to my monthly administrative load.""}]}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: I am leaning toward B. The risk of social fracture from A is too high, and C is unmanageable.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: I’m torn. The daily riders want to pay, but I fear a lottery will just make them feel ignored.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: I am choosing C. The physical reality of the rain and the shoving match demands a structural fix, not a paper one.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I’m voting B. A is unaffordable, C is unmanageable. B is the only one that doesn’t bankrupt us or break the building.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I am voting B. It is the only option that does not add to my monthly administrative load.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: I am voting B. It is the only option that preserves the peace in our lobby.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: I’m voting B. It’s the only option that doesn’t add to the burden, even if it feels imperfect.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: I am voting C. The physical layout is the root cause, and only shared racks address it directly.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am voting B. It is the only option that doesn’t bankrupt us or break the building.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I am voting B. It is the only option that does not add to my monthly administrative load.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
